		(property "Description" "GPIO5 SPI-mode strap pull-down for anchor A2 (DW3210 pin 5). Defines SPI mode 0 at power-up, per the DW3000 'Sample GPIOs 5&6 to set SPI mode' step in Figures 1 and 2."
